849	     * column layout, so reordering children would move the dock from
850	     * the bottom (after the status bar) up to the top of the screen.
851	     * standby_overlay is full-screen, opaque and move_foreground()ed,
852	     * so HIDDEN alone keeps the dock off the lock screen. */
